import VersoManual
import LeanGeodesyManual.Chapters.CRS

open Verso.Genre Manual

#doc (Manual) "Part III: Coordinate reference systems" =>

A coordinate reference system says what a pair of numbers is measured
against. This part builds the CRSs a web map uses from Part I, converts
between them, and separates conversions within a datum from transformations
between datums.

{include 1 LeanGeodesyManual.Chapters.CRS}
